  /// guarantee «one message per cart, forever» used to live entirely on the
  /// outbox row — and the retention sweep deletes settled outbox rows at 90
  /// days, so «forever» quietly meant «every 90 days». The stamp lives on the
  /// cart because the cart is what the guarantee is about, and it outlives any
  /// retention number. See notifications/abandoned-cart-scanner.ts.
  abandonedNotifiedAt DateTime?     @map("abandoned_notified_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)
  mergedIntoCartId  String?         @map("merged_into_cart_id") @db.Uuid
  convertedOrderId  String?         @map("converted_order_id") @db.Uuid
